## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Kubernetes cluster with Crossplane installed
- AWS provider configured in Crossplane
- kubectl configured

### Local Development

{% if values.runtime == 'nodejs' %}
```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```
{% elif values.runtime == 'golang' %}
```bash
go mod download
go run cmd/{{ values.name }}/main.go
```
{% elif values.runtime == 'python' %}
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```
{% endif %}

### Deploy Infrastructure

```bash
# Deploy to dev environment
kubectl apply -f crossplane/claim-dev.yaml

# Wait for resources to be ready
kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready compositeresource.claim.apiextensions.crossplane.io/{{ values.name }}-dev --timeout=300s
```

### Deploy Application

```bash
kubectl apply -f k8s/
kubectl rollout status deployment/{{ values.name }}
```

